sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant FE as Profile page
  participant RS as ResumeSkillService
  participant X as ResumeTextExtractor
  participant G as Gemini API
  S->>FE: Upload resume
  FE->>RS: POST /api/student/resume/skills
  RS->>X: read text (PDFBox for PDF, Apache POI for DOC/DOCX)
  X-->>RS: plain text
  alt Gemini key set
    RS->>G: skill catalog + resume text, answer as JSON
    G-->>RS: [{name, evidence quote}, ...]
    RS->>RS: keep only suggestions whose quote is really in the resume
  else offline
    RS->>RS: keyword patterns (springboot, spring-boot, RESTful ...)
  end
  RS-->>FE: suggestions with evidence (nothing saved yet)
  S->>FE: Untick any, click "Add skills"
  FE->>RS: POST /api/student/profile/skills
  FE-->>S: Career Map recalculated
